{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42550","headline":"句 · 幸夤逊","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苦教作镇居中国，争得泥金在泰山。\n才闻暖律先偷眼，既待和风始展眉。\n蒙君知重惠琼实，薄起金刀钉玉深。\n嚼处春冰敲齿冷，咽时雪液沃心寒。\n深妆玉瓦平无壠，乱拂芦花细有声。\n日回禽影穿疎木，风递猨声入小楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"幸夤逊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42550.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42550","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}